WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.011 --> 00:00:02.757
<v 0>This is how you help me. You put money on yourself,</v>

2
00:00:02.797 --> 00:00:05.155
sleep 7 hours, get a workout in,

3
00:00:05.686 --> 00:00:08.097
and your wearable decides. And Spotter,

4
00:00:08.105 --> 00:00:12.308
our settlement agent, pays out. Your health data never touches the chain,

5
00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:15.966
only the result. So,

6
00:00:15.966 --> 00:00:19.036
everyone's stake's the same, and if you hit it, you get your stake back,

7
00:00:19.036 --> 00:00:21.493
plus a share of what the people who missed put in.

8
00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:26.023
Miss it, and your wearable shows it. Your stake goes to the people who

9
00:00:26.023 --> 00:00:28.230
hit. No data, and you get it back.

10
00:00:28.741 --> 00:00:33.736
Nobody gets burned by a sync bug. Before

11
00:00:33.736 --> 00:00:35.933
you play, you make your player ones.

12
00:00:36.037 --> 00:00:40.622
World ID proves that I'm one real human,

13
00:00:40.622 --> 00:00:43.681
so nobody farms entities with extra wallets.

14
00:00:44.681 --> 00:00:49.681
Each

15
00:00:53.756 --> 00:00:56.028
person proves once, and that's the point.

16
00:00:56.028 --> 00:00:58.640
I'm verified, and my name is andre.gohealthme.ath,

17
00:00:58.640 --> 00:01:03.057
and you can ENS V2 name on Sepolia,

18
00:01:03.337 --> 00:01:08.223
and my whoop is paired. Last night I joined this one workout challenge,

19
00:01:08.791 --> 00:01:10.888
did a walk, and spotter read my whoop.

20
00:01:11.711 --> 00:01:14.428
Before paying it asked me to confirm it was really me.

21
00:01:14.428 --> 00:01:19.726
With my world ID. My first request expired

22
00:01:19.726 --> 00:01:21.924
and nothing moved. That is the safety net.

23
00:01:22.144 --> 00:01:26.710
I confirmed the second, and Interceptor screened my wallet against sanctions list,

24
00:01:27.463 --> 00:01:30.471
and it recorded on chain, banked.

25
00:01:45.783 --> 00:01:46.434
And these ones here are live right now. Same stake, and I missed go

26
00:01:46.434 --> 00:01:51.169
sign. Users can create their own challenges

27
00:01:51.633 --> 00:01:55.102
to achieve their various health goals.

28
00:01:55.684 --> 00:02:00.520
And right now we're offering verification through your wearables on sleep and

29
00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:02.556
workout activity.

30
00:02:02.556 --> 00:02:05.823
This is our continuity build.

31
00:02:05.823 --> 00:02:08.424
V1 won at ETH Global New York,

32
00:02:08.424 --> 00:02:11.004
and V3 was a pilot on base.

33
00:02:11.409 --> 00:02:14.521
And this weekend we added world ID, ENS names,

34
00:02:14.543 --> 00:02:18.599
and interceptor screening, and made the commitment model rail.

35
00:02:18.599 --> 00:02:21.023
It's in beta on base Apolia test money.
